          "docs": "<p>Lists information about your private certificate authority (CA) or one that has been shared with you. You specify the private CA on input by its ARN (Amazon Resource Name). The output contains the status of your CA. This can be any of the following: </p> <ul> <li> <p> <code>CREATING</code> - Amazon Web Services Private CA is creating your private certificate authority.</p> </li> <li> <p> <code>PENDING_CERTIFICATE</code> - The certificate is pending. You must use your Amazon Web Services Priva"
